//   https://www.isaca.org/-/media/files/isacadp/project/isaca/certification/exam-candidate-guides/2026/exam-candidate-guide.pdf
//   https://www.isaca.org/credentialing/cisa/cisa-exam-content-outline
// Incident response plan and phases (preparation; detection and analysis; containment, eradication and recovery; post-incident
//   activity; lessons learned): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_security_incident_management ; NIST SP 800-61 Rev. 3, April
